OL,3,GNEWSAOn patrol with the officers
OL,4,Abattling a city's serial shoplifters
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorfolk's police and crime commissioner
OL,7,Fsays the force is one of the best in
OL,8,Fthe country at catching shoplifters.
OL,9,FThe BBC went out on patrol with police
OL,10,Fofficers tackling retail crime in
OL,11,FNorwich.
OL,13,FAs PC Ben Blewitt, retail beat manager
OL,14,Ffor Norwich, walks through the city
OL,15,Fcentre, shopkeepers come out to thank
OL,16,Fhim and share the latest intelligence
OL,17,Fon serial shoplifters.
OL,19,FThey use an app to log information and
OL,20,Fcommunicate with officers in real time,
OL,21,Freporting live incidents and sharing
OL,22,FCCTV evidence.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
